{"title":"Agent如何节省Token？","slug":"kgwsgvw916l1pptl","html":"<div class=\"yuque-imported\"><p id=\"ucd2e8253\"><span id=\"u92538e5f\">下面按“普通 ChatGPT/Codex 用户”和“API 开发者”分别说明。核心思路是：减少输入、减少历史上下文、减少模型内部推理，以及限制最终输出。</span></p><h2 id=\"156875b9\"><span><span id=\"u5fea56ef\">1. 定期压缩上下文，不要无限续聊</span></span></h2><p id=\"u31821a94\"><span id=\"ua0dbbe3c\">在长对话里，每次回答都可能需要读取大量历史消息。真正浪费 token 的通常不是你刚发的这句话，而是前面几十轮已经失效的讨论、错误尝试和重复资料。</span></p><h3 id=\"c276699c\"><span><span id=\"u04920ad9\">普通用户如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"uda035f13\"><span id=\"u8ff9319d\">适合压缩的时机：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"ucea5664e\"><span id=\"uac6a021c\">一个阶段已经结束，例如调研完成、方案已经选定。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u77560463\"><span id=\"u41a6154d\">对话超过十几轮，模型开始忘记新要求。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u1093daa1\"><span id=\"u2d75da80\">前面有大量被推翻的方案。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u20c434e9\"><span id=\"u26e60978\">准备从“分析问题”进入“执行方案”。</span></span></div><p id=\"uc1fc44e1\"><span id=\"uaae0da8c\">先让模型生成交接摘要：</span></p><div id=\"uec52a78d\"><pre><code>请把当前对话压缩成一份可以在新对话中继续使用的上下文。\n\n只保留：\n1. 当前目标\n2. 已确认的事实和数据\n3. 已做出的决定及原因\n4. 必须遵守的约束\n5. 未解决的问题\n6. 下一步行动\n7. 需要继续使用的文件、链接或术语\n\n删除：\n- 寒暄和重复内容\n- 已经被否定的方案\n- 无关的推理过程\n- 失败尝试的详细过程\n\n要求：控制在 800 字以内，不能添加对话中不存在的信息。</code></pre></div><p id=\"u38ab92c5\"><span id=\"ua6855772\">然后：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"ue5d22cc1\"><span id=\"u4317e95c\">检查摘要有没有遗漏关键数字和约束。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"u31bd9470\"><span id=\"u293c9077\">手动修正错误。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"u402c1175\"><span id=\"u4aed100f\">新建对话。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>4.</span></span><span id=\"u9c22157f\"><span id=\"ud49672a7\">粘贴摘要，并补一句：“以上是上一阶段的确认结果，请从下一步行动开始。”</span></span></div><p id=\"u8dd430e2\"><span id=\"ua407deb3\">不要让模型仅仅“总结一下”，否则它可能写成复盘文章，而不是可以继续工作的上下文。</span></p><h3 id=\"568a196f\"><span><span id=\"u88deebd5\">API 如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"ued7e8daa\"><span id=\"u7cd39c33\">长流程可以使用 Responses API 的 Compaction：</span></p><div id=\"u4f04ef35\"><pre><code>compacted = client.responses.compact(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    input=long_window,\n)\n\nresponse = client.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    input=[\n        *compacted.output,\n        {\n            \"role\": \"user\",\n            \"content\": \"根据已有结论，开始制定实施计划。\"\n        },\n    ],\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"u3a114ab3\"><span id=\"u1a53e765\">注意：API 返回的 compacted output 是机器上下文，不是普通摘要，官方建议原样传入，不要编辑。</span></p><p id=\"ud288b2e4\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/deployment-checklist#leverage-compaction\"><span id=\"ufa539d8f\">官方说明：Compaction</span></a></p><div id=\"u58d35b20\"><hr id=\"RR0cD\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"f61fed98\"><span><span id=\"u45da0224\">2. 明确规定答案长度和输出结构</span></span></h2><p id=\"uda87ddf1\"><span id=\"u4e0f3aa4\">“详细分析一下”“全面介绍一下”会给模型很大的输出空间。模型可能生成大量背景介绍、重复结论和礼貌性文字。</span></p><h3 id=\"c276699c-1\"><span><span id=\"u8d774e31\">普通用户如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"u60867a19\"><span id=\"uc1763b8d\">提示词里同时写清楚四件事：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"ub02bc1ce\"><span id=\"u88b144a2\">要回答什么。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"u00caef0d\"><span id=\"udc9c870e\">不需要回答什么。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"u2f4912d5\"><span id=\"u765ac318\">输出多少内容。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>4.</span></span><span id=\"u9c942838\"><span id=\"u21ce0d9c\">使用什么格式。</span></span></div><p id=\"u1bce0b52\"><span id=\"ub5ef2719\">例如，不建议这样写：</span></p><div id=\"ue6acd969\"><pre><code>帮我详细分析这个产品。</code></pre></div><p id=\"u1fe00941\"><span id=\"u1c3f5f10\">可以改成：</span></p><div id=\"u391f8482\"><pre><code>分析这个产品的 onboarding 流程。\n\n只输出：\n1. 3 个主要问题\n2. 每个问题的一条证据\n3. 每个问题的一条修改建议\n\n每点不超过 80 字，总字数不超过 500 字。\n不要复述产品背景，不写开场白和总结。</code></pre></div><p id=\"uf7956e20\"><span id=\"u0939d8ac\">其他可直接复用的限制语：</span></p><div id=\"ua6d42583\"><pre><code>只给结论和必要依据。</code></pre></div><div id=\"ub9eeb8e0\"><pre><code>使用表格回答，最多 5 行。</code></pre></div><div id=\"u28446d8c\"><pre><code>给我 3 个方案，不要生成更多备选项。</code></pre></div><div id=\"u7154e624\"><pre><code>先给 200 字以内的版本；我需要时再让你展开。</code></pre></div><p id=\"ub874469d\"><span id=\"u6032af1b\">最后一种“分层获取信息”非常省 token：先获得短答案，只对真正重要的部分继续追问。</span></p><h3 id=\"568a196f-1\"><span><span id=\"u38cf8c18\">API 如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"u16c7abd3\"><span id=\"u57108a34\">使用低 verbosity：</span></p><div id=\"u2be6781a\"><pre><code>response = client.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    text={\"verbosity\": \"low\"},\n    input=\"用三个要点总结这份报告，不超过200字。\",\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"u26360c4a\"><span id=\"ub27c58a9\">还可以设置硬性的输出上限：</span></p><div id=\"ufe3e46ac\"><pre><code>response = client.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    text={\"verbosity\": \"low\"},\n    max_output_tokens=300,\n    input=prompt,\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"ua31ca252\"><span id=\"u5cd4a9c1\">两者区别：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u56a5bd9b\"><code><span><span id=\"ufa60337d\">verbosity: \"low\"</span></span></code><span id=\"u1b006c6d\">让模型主动采用更精简的表达。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"udbb9a8e8\"><code><span><span id=\"u303ea1a5\">max_output_tokens</span></span></code><span id=\"u880f8b66\">是硬上限，设置过低可能导致答案中途截断。</span></span></div><p id=\"u53049fb2\"><span id=\"ub0403f65\">因此最好先通过提示词和低 verbosity 控制长度，再用 </span><code><span><span id=\"uc1f85868\">max_output_tokens</span></span></code><span id=\"ua82a927e\">防止异常长输出。</span></p><p id=\"u9061cb7e\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/deployment-checklist#set-up-textverbosity\"><span id=\"uf610aafd\">官方说明：text.verbosity</span></a></p><div id=\"u80b13e4f\"><hr id=\"oj5WS\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"a51a21c7\"><span><span id=\"ucfa27c24\">3. 简单任务不要使用过高的推理强度</span></span></h2><p id=\"u62282473\"><span id=\"u34eff50c\">推理模型在输出答案前可能消耗 reasoning tokens。翻译一句话、提取字段和判断文本类别，通常不需要与复杂代码调试相同的推理强度。</span></p><h3 id=\"7520703f\"><span><span id=\"u528a44a4\">如何判断该用什么强度</span></span></h3><div id=\"u87913fb0\"><div id=\"PpLlQ\"><div><div><div class=\"yuque-table-scroll\"><table style=\"width: 750px;\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"/><col width=\"374\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><div><p id=\"u257e62e6\"><span id=\"u8128e7d4\" style=\";font-weight:700\">任务</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"ubf5245b5\"><span id=\"ufb22ca32\" style=\";font-weight:700\">建议强度</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u874cff2e\"><span id=\"ue761cd09\">翻译、分类、摘取信息、格式转换</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u3bd6c984\"><code><span><span id=\"u8e0ece84\">low</span></span></code></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u1dc41e82\"><span id=\"ueb95a423\">写初稿、一般分析、简单代码修改</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"uf67bffa3\"><code><span><span id=\"u3cf22335\">medium</span></span></code></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u18a85771\"><span id=\"ufd891478\">多方案权衡、问题诊断、复杂规划</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u1ac1541f\"><code><span><span id=\"uc616dd53\">medium</span></span></code><span id=\"u28360cf0\"> 或 </span><code><span><span id=\"u1b876e60\">high</span></span></code></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u84a06539\"><span id=\"u4be2bce8\">高难度研究、安全审查、复杂系统调试</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u872d3427\"><code><span><span id=\"u67264a13\">high</span></span></code></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><h3 id=\"c276699c-2\"><span><span id=\"ua6873bc1\">普通用户如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"u9e1f0ecd\"><span id=\"u61682622\">如果产品界面提供“快速、标准、深度思考”等模式：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"uda6a189b\"><span id=\"u2b86ff06\">翻译、润色、摘要选择快速模式。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u01d05625\"><span id=\"u98b913c9\">一般创作和分析选择标准模式。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u01fdc4b3\"><span id=\"u895900fb\">只有真正复杂的问题才选择深度思考。</span></span></div><p id=\"u2d7ae438\"><span id=\"u178891a0\">提示词中也不要在简单任务里习惯性加入：</span></p><div id=\"u8573c335\"><pre><code>请进行非常深入的思考。\n请一步一步反复验证。\n考虑所有可能性。</code></pre></div><p id=\"uc74545fc\"><span id=\"u7dcb5aea\">这些要求可能让模型做超出任务需要的工作。</span></p><p id=\"u9ec7dbd2\"><span id=\"u61735f50\">可以改为：</span></p><div id=\"ud3e06a1a\"><pre><code>这是一个简单的信息提取任务，不需要展开分析。\n只提取姓名、公司和职位，输出 JSON。</code></pre></div><p id=\"u1eecfb07\"><span id=\"u368e1a17\">不过需要注意：普通聊天界面的提示词只能影响模型行为，不能像 API 参数那样精确控制内部 reasoning tokens。</span></p><h3 id=\"568a196f-2\"><span><span id=\"ucb1094a5\">API 如何操作</span></span></h3><div id=\"uc863b62c\"><pre><code>response = client.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    reasoning={\"effort\": \"low\"},\n    input=\"把这封邮件分类为投诉、咨询或表扬，只返回类别。\",\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"ua30fb183\"><span id=\"u9ab958de\">推荐的测试方法：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"u4c74893b\"><span id=\"u9733fecd\">选取 20～50 个真实任务作为测试集。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"ud42c0e40\"><span id=\"u4e11d293\">先用 </span><code><span><span id=\"u1956daee\">medium</span></span></code><span id=\"uc4cd753a\">运行，记录正确率和 token。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"uebfd464b\"><span id=\"u1973af1f\">改成 </span><code><span><span id=\"u08a9d715\">low</span></span></code><span id=\"ub56c30a4\">再次运行。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>4.</span></span><span id=\"uc7701cf5\"><span id=\"u2fe1e65c\">如果正确率没有明显下降，就采用 </span><code><span><span id=\"u330e1837\">low</span></span></code><span id=\"u98faee9b\">。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>5.</span></span><span id=\"uf4a538f6\"><span id=\"ua1260d64\">不要只根据一两个示例决定。</span></span></div><p id=\"u2f33968a\"><span id=\"u5ceb6121\">这样省下的是 reasoning tokens，但代价可能是复杂任务质量下降。</span></p><p id=\"u1367095b\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning#reasoning-effort\"><span id=\"u11b32878\">官方说明：Reasoning effort</span></a></p><div id=\"u7f0c7bd8\"><hr id=\"VE1U3\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"d61598aa\"><span><span id=\"u74b2196d\">4. 先检索相关片段，不要每次发送整份资料</span></span></h2><p id=\"udfa37690\"><span id=\"u84fe49b0\">如果问题只涉及文档中的一小部分，把几十页资料全部放进提示词通常没有必要。更好的流程是：先找到相关内容，再把相关内容交给模型分析。</span></p><h3 id=\"c276699c-3\"><span><span id=\"u44cccf69\">普通用户如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"uf2a1cbb7\"><span id=\"u29754ad7\">例如你有一份 80 页的研究报告，需要了解留存率。</span></p><p id=\"u5e172898\"><span id=\"u81502e28\">不建议直接说：</span></p><div id=\"u7309975d\"><pre><code>请阅读整份报告，告诉我留存率怎么样。</code></pre></div><p id=\"udcb6a3aa\"><span id=\"u0dceb807\">更节省的方法：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"u882ee729\"><span id=\"uce6032ef\">先搜索“留存、次日留存、7 日留存、retention”等关键词。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"u82317aa8\"><span id=\"u84ee8eae\">找到相关的 3～5 个页面或段落。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"u360d47e7\"><span id=\"u5540bb30\">只提交这些内容。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>4.</span></span><span id=\"uf4d527e9\"><span id=\"u246f41c7\">明确要求模型仅基于所给片段回答。</span></span></div><p id=\"u08e7d4e8\"><span id=\"u7b891091\">可复制提示词：</span></p><div id=\"uee969fe0\"><pre><code>下面是报告中与用户留存有关的 4 个片段。\n\n任务：\n1. 提取所有留存指标\n2. 标明指标口径、时间范围和样本\n3. 指出片段之间是否存在冲突\n\n只能使用所给片段，不补充外部信息。\n如果证据不足，直接写“资料不足”。\n\n[片段1]\n……\n\n[片段2]\n……</code></pre></div><p id=\"u6e72eff0\"><span id=\"uabbf3ec6\">如果必须上传完整文件，可以把问题范围限制得更具体：</span></p><div id=\"u0661664c\"><pre><code>只检查第 12～18 页与用户留存相关的内容。\n不要总结其他章节。</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"568a196f-3\"><span><span id=\"ue8412df7\">API 如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"ua5c79f1e\"><span id=\"u6229d21d\">把文档建立为 Vector Store，然后只获取最相关的少量片段：</span></p><div id=\"u629027de\"><pre><code>results = client.vector_stores.search(\n    vector_store_id=\"vs_123\",\n    query=\"产品7日留存率的定义、数据和统计周期\",\n    max_num_results=4,\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"u0f0cc398\"><span id=\"ue678f745\">实际使用时：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u4afb5579\"><span id=\"u5bbf9b10\">初始设置 </span><code><span><span id=\"u3ea4c869\">max_num_results=3～5</span></span></code><span id=\"u472bbb0e\">。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u25904e9d\"><span id=\"ubde2c7ac\">用日期、地区、产品版本等 metadata 过滤。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"uce75d69f\"><span id=\"u85aa729a\">将相似度过低的结果排除。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"ua277bd71\"><span id=\"u79441522\">只把最终筛选出的片段放进生成请求。</span></span></div><p id=\"ude53a223\"><span id=\"uf91b53fb\">不要盲目把结果数量降到 1。过度节省可能漏掉反例、指标口径或者更新版本。应该使用真实问题测试“召回率”和回答准确度。</span></p><p id=\"ua7f98193\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/retrieval#performing-semantic-search\"><span id=\"ud5d4887c\">官方说明：Retrieval</span></a></p><div id=\"u36be6d4a\"><hr id=\"FCH98\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"62dea1e3\"><span><span id=\"u9ce199d6\">5. 图片和 PDF 优先使用低清、裁剪和文本提取</span></span></h2><p id=\"ud37b8f1f\"><span id=\"u5810f509\">图片不是“免费附件”，视觉模型也需要把图片转换成 token。高分辨率图片、长截图、多页 PDF 都可能显著增加输入量。</span></p><h3 id=\"0dce9231\"><span><span id=\"u29ff853a\">图片如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"uaa32a7e8\"><span id=\"u960e6d31\">上传前先做三件事：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"u8a233589\"><span id=\"u73f91746\">裁掉与问题无关的区域。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"u90a5de99\"><span id=\"u4b298f06\">一次只提交真正需要比较的图片。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"u2b5b6011\"><span id=\"u9a672b39\">根据任务决定是否需要高精度。</span></span></div><p id=\"u86ff51ae\"><span id=\"u7dde389f\">适合低清的任务：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u61bae0fa\"><span id=\"u8153b509\">判断图片里有什么主体。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"uaef6117a\"><span id=\"ubf576015\">识别大致页面结构。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u896a9be7\"><span id=\"u3aa03a82\">判断整体风格和配色。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"uabcb4ebd\"><span id=\"ud0771a22\">检查明显的布局问题。</span></span></div><p id=\"u2cc3e579\"><span id=\"u28865a1a\">需要高精度的任务：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"ue5af905f\"><span id=\"u494b6491\">OCR 很小的文字。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u31bec670\"><span id=\"u3eecad72\">检查数据图表。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u43cbf071\"><span id=\"u1c3e4cc6\">分析密集 UI 截图。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u6aae922e\"><span id=\"u445f7e16\">检查像素级视觉问题。</span></span></div><p id=\"udcf6ad60\"><span id=\"u278e880a\">例如，不要上传整张 4K 网页长截图，然后问按钮颜色。应先裁剪到按钮所在区域。</span></p><h3 id=\"b222ceef\"><span><span id=\"uca2cde54\">PDF 如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"u4aaa4b96\"><span id=\"u3774abc7\">PDF 可能同时把“提取出的文字”和“每页页面图像”放入上下文，因此尤其容易增加 token。</span></p><p id=\"u7ac8c6bc\"><span id=\"u243aeccf\">可以这样处理：</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u0bb65db2\"><span id=\"ud9f08c56\">只需要文字内容：先导出或复制为纯文本。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"u1e7b1b42\"><span id=\"u18a2ec56\">只需要某一章节：只上传对应页面。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"ue48781e1\"><span id=\"ud9e69f51\">只需要表格：把表格单独导出。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"ud17ec3ac\"><span id=\"u408056d0\">只需要视觉版式：只提交有代表性的几页截图。</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item yuque-list-unordered\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span><span>●</span></span></span><span id=\"uca74b80f\"><span id=\"u2ac6a794\">扫描版 PDF：先 OCR，再删除页眉、页脚和重复水印。</span></span></div><h3 id=\"568a196f-4\"><span><span id=\"u779e9d34\">API 如何操作</span></span></h3><p id=\"ua3a54695\"><span id=\"u7a601a3b\">分析普通图片时可以设置低精度：</span></p><div id=\"ufc22dffa\"><pre><code>response = client.responses.create(\n    model=\"gpt-5.6\",\n    input=[{\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"input_text\",\n                \"text\": \"只判断这个页面属于登录页还是注册页。\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"input_image\",\n                \"image_url\": image_url,\n                \"detail\": \"low\"\n            }\n        ]\n    }]\n)</code></pre></div><p id=\"uc19ea179\"><span id=\"u460d3075\">第一次可以先用 </span><code><span><span id=\"ua048069e\">low</span></span></code><span id=\"u918f5dfa\">。只有结果显示看不清小字或细节时，再对局部图片使用 </span><code><span><span id=\"u46ed58c0\">high</span></span></code><span id=\"u62f6c933\">，不要一开始就对所有图片启用高精度。</span></p><p id=\"u860de64d\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/images-vision#analyze-images\"><span id=\"uaa2c269c\">官方说明：Images and vision</span></a><span id=\"u270e93ec\"> · </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/file-inputs#usage-considerations\"><span id=\"u6e004d8e\">PDF token 注意事项</span></a></p><p id=\"u9ec06e71\"><span id=\"ua1514dd7\">最后可以记住一个简单顺序：</span></p><p id=\"u82af17a5\"><span id=\"ue0568670\">先删无关上下文 → 再限制输出 → 再降低推理强度 → 再减少检索片段 → 最后优化图片和 PDF。</span></p></div>","summary":"下面按“普通 ChatGPT/Codex 用户”和“API 开发者”分别说明。核心思路是：减少输入、减少历史上下文、减少模型内部推理，以及限制最终输出。 1. 定期压缩上下文，不要无限续聊 在长对话里，每次回答都可能需要读取大量历史消息。真正浪费 token 的通常不是你刚发的这","category":"Vibe Coding 工作流","topicId":"vibe-coding","tags":["Vibe Coding 工作流"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/abyssalsailor/yg90qa/kgwsgvw916l1pptl","updatedAt":"2026-08-17","order":161,"featured":false,"wordCount":2491}
